        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana R2001, R-Series Solid Brass \"L\" Shaped Toilet Paper Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis wall mounted toilet tissue dispenser is made out of brass and is available in an array of different finished so that you will be sure to find the perfect one. The R-Series Toilet Paper Holder is made with the attention to quality for which Deltana is known. The classic mounts look will look great in any traditional decor.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2001-specifications.gif?v=1704354640\" width=\"437\" height=\"287\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana R2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana R Series\"><b>Deltana R-Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the R Series Solid Brass Single Post Toilet Paper Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 7-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Mount Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-R2001.pdf?v=1704262289\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana R2001 Toilet Paper Holder Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 toilet tissue holder, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
